{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國女團BLACKPINK成員Lisa個人事業發展順遂，身為寶格麗（BVLGARI）全球代言人的她，近日獲邀出席品牌活動。Lisa選穿一襲暗黑風格的蕾絲長裙亮相，極具衝擊力的性感造型一登場即成為全場焦點。</p><figure><img alt=\"Lisa是頂級珠寶品牌寶格麗（BVLGARI）的全球品牌代言人。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175125800312639488703985.jpeg/R8sdXL3eDC5tih-2NlT9NfY6ArbVsrp6LV5D2y1eQ9s\"/><figcaption>Lisa是頂級珠寶品牌寶格麗（BVLGARI）的全球品牌代言人。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lisa同框安海瑟薇（中）、杜娃黎波（左）陣容超豪華。（IG@bvlgari）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175130489699176448954376.jpeg/GtYy_G4ioHTHNJ_qj2KOHvVDjsPjn20ztagqF7WoKhc\"/><figcaption>Lisa同框安海瑟薇（中）、杜娃黎波（左）陣容超豪華。（IG@bvlgari）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lisa身穿黑色蕾絲透視長裙現身。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175125788035387392042871.jpeg/OpqgrS2KYd4mLtYoMXg6uaGe4dNMPne9voYa3L6GGtw\"/><figcaption>Lisa身穿黑色蕾絲透視長裙現身。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><p>透視裸色內襯展現完美身材曲線</p><p>Lisa身穿的長裙視覺效果極度震撼，黑色蕾絲內搭貼近膚色的裸色內襯。加上腰側與髖骨處更留下性感鏤空，將其高挑纖細的身材優勢發揮得淋漓盡致。正面透視裸色內襯極具視覺衝擊，轉過身更驚喜大露背，完美展現高挑纖腰與白滑性感美背。Lisa同時佩戴品牌經典蛇形高級珠寶項鍊與耳環，整體造型華麗又火辣。</p><figure><img alt=\"黑色蕾絲搭配裸色內襯極具視覺衝擊。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175125791441162240837061.jpeg/ObkRE0oTyGDqSafXKbKcXWgfhxen9go1-6cxD_unMQ8\"/><figcaption>黑色蕾絲搭配裸色內襯極具視覺衝擊。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"超Sexy！（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175125793618137088104569.jpeg/N17hz8xK5VvsJHq5hP3ar5t92hJ7f30J90l_WfdJf1k\"/><figcaption>超Sexy！（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"整體造型華麗又火辣。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175125798005641216809735.jpeg/v0ckNZQmd19eJXvJORNg6ZotzrpZA2CI1cV8CNXFfAg\"/><figcaption>整體造型華麗又火辣。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"佩戴品牌經典蛇形高級珠寶首飾。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175125795908358144507461.jpeg/UupH1KQLxkvUw7jMFjGYlqCLKDiUedxK6aoHAOmqBwA\"/><figcaption>佩戴品牌經典蛇形高級珠寶首飾。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><p>新歌MV點擊率狂飆破紀錄爆紅全球</p><p>除了時尚界大放異彩，Lisa本月初更強勢推出全新單曲〈SaWaDiKa〉。新曲MV回到家鄉曼谷取景，將泰拳與篤篤車等泰國文化元素搬上國際舞台。MV上架短短24小時便突破7千萬次觀看，創下2026年YouTube超強紀錄！</p><figure><img alt=\"Lisa全新單曲〈SaWaDiKa〉。（〈SaWaDiKa〉MV截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172587525596909568253460.png/ai2nHzcqLB3aHR7roMw6hNh8ljzHazS8igQqbIoEKmw\"/><figcaption>Lisa全新單曲〈SaWaDiKa〉。（〈SaWaDiKa〉MV截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"MV上架短短24小時便突破7千萬次觀看。（〈SaWaDiKa〉MV截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172587528977649664268579.png/DTtn-clzf6yuORq1bOxHU-ypn7zyU1rP47iV8OO4lfA\"/><figcaption>MV上架短短24小時便突破7千萬次觀看。（〈SaWaDiKa〉MV截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T08:18:24.753318+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":708,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}